      "final_text": "I added `pages/pricing.html` and `pages/contact.html`, and they are now part of the shared repo. T1 as a whole is not finished.\n\n- **Pricing:** a `pricing-table` comparing Free ($0), Pro ($8/mo) and Team ($15/user/mo), with a header row and five feature rows.\n- **Contact:** a `contact-form` with labelled name, email and message fields, a submit button, and a `mailto:hello@acme.example` link.\n- **Tests:** `python -m pytest -q` passed locally before I pushed, but it only has the one existing smoke test. I added no tests of my own.\n\nNobody else had pushed anything or claimed files when I last checked, and no review is waiting on me. I posted a suggested split on T1 but have seen no replies.\n\nStill to do, by that split:\n- **@a1:** `build.py` (it doesn't set `aria-current=\"page\"` yet), the full `components/nav.html`, and the tests.\n- **@a2:** `index.html` and `about.html`.\n- **@a3:** `features.html` and `styles.css`.\n\nI have not declared T1 done, since the home, features and about pages, the nav, the stylesheet and the tests are all unbuilt.",
